{
  "title": { "zh": "改写" },
  "adds": ["rw"],
  "tray": "machine",
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "「刮风 ∧ ¬¬下雨」里的 ¬¬下雨 换成下雨，在证明板上要先拆开外面的「并且」，换掉里面那一句，再拼回去。"
      }
    },
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "两句话等价，句子里出现一句的地方就能直接换成另一句。这样用的等价式叫<wiki-ref to=\"rewrite\"></wiki-ref>，新元件<part-ref to=\"part:rw\"></part-ref>按一条改写规则在目标里换一处。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "after": {
    "zh": "这是<wiki-ref to=\"simplifier\"></wiki-ref>的基本动作。"
  },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "sp-rw",
      "kind": "machine",
      "want": "becomes",
      "inputs": [{ "name": "in", "label": { "zh": "目标" } }],
      "backtrack": true,
      "tests": [
        { "goal": "Wind ∧ ¬¬Rain", "becomes": [["Wind ∧ Rain"]] },
        { "goal": "¬¬Wet → Slip", "becomes": [["Wet → Slip"]] },
        { "goal": "(Rain ∨ ¬¬Wind) ∧ Wet", "becomes": [["(Rain ∨ Wind) ∧ Wet"]] }
      ],
      "brief": { "zh": "设计一个证明助手，去掉每个目标里的 ¬¬。" },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "<part-ref to=\"lemma:dneg\"></part-ref>的两个形状都可以当改写规则。"
        }
      ],
      "solution": ["c0r0 = dneg[use=[\"dneg.elim\"]]()", "c0 = rw(in, c0r0)", "out <- c0"]
    }
  ]
}
